      "openalex_id": "W2286345181",
      "doi": "10.26021/5160",
      "title": "Dwelling Among the Waves: Modernist Architecture, Walter Benjamin, and the Mythology of Modernity.",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "van Drunen, Martha Elke",
